    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Fridays, Sep 18-Nov 20 | The Makana Choirs are the place to develop healthy singing habits, learn musical literary skills, and put on a concert. All while having fun with friends! Makana is directed by Caroni Young. ++ The Makana Kids Choir is for singers in grades 2-5. This class is a fun introduction to [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
