    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>&nbsp; League 181 was established in 2013 by a small group of experienced painters with the compact of mutual help, learning and development. The central idea is that we benefit by painting together in a group, both by discussion of the craft and by observation of each other. 181 painters are: Judith Borbas, Peter Eyles, [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
