    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>&nbsp; It all started with a strange and fantastical dream…. The sea is sparkling and laughing as the last rays of summer sunlight turn everything to gold. A vast shoal of fish breaks the surface, riding its crest are countless numbers of happy babies. They are safely delivered to the beach where I stand with [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
      }
