    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>NEW DATE: WEDNESDAY, 4 NOVEMBER 2026 at 7.30pm ---- Few artists capture the beauty, humour, and complexity of modern life quite like Dan Mangan – and with Natural Lights, Mangan returns to his songs-for-the-camp-fire roots. Completely unplanned and recorded over six days by four best buds in a cabin by a lake, Mangan describes it [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
