    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SS Forum Presents Jason Kenney: Can Canada Hold Together?"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Canada has always been a country of competing identities, regional priorities, and political differences. But today, these tensions feel stronger than before. Many Canadians are asking a difficult question: What holds us together—and what could pull us apart? Few people have been closer to these debates than Jason Kenney. A former Premier of Alberta and [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
      }
    ],
