    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Nine musicians. Distinct traditions. Infinite possibilities. Interweave Ensemble brings together nine extraordinary musicians whose artistic roots span Africa, Asia, the Caribbean and Turtle Island. Drawing upon the depth of repertoire, knowledge, and experience each musician brings, Interweave creates a space where distinct musical traditions meet on equal terms. Rather than requiring artists to compromise their [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
