        "@value": "<p>&nbsp; A photographic retrospective celebrating the remarkable breadth and quality of live music on Salt Spring Island in 2026, and the emotional range of the musicians who bring it to life. The exhibition brings together two distinctive photographic styles: the rich, saturated colours and intensity of live performance, and the quieter, more pensive world of [&hellip;]</p>\\n"
