        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Salt Spring Film Festival presents Farruquito: A Flamenco Dynasty"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Hailed as the finest dancer of his generation, Farruquito leads a legendary flamenco dynasty that channels raw emotion and family bonds into electrifying performances. Packed with extraordinary music and dance, this documentary chronicles a sweeping, operatic saga of passion, artistry, and generational legacy. BUY TICKETS Trailer: https://youtu.be/C1LpsFYrSb8 &nbsp;</p>\\n"
      }
